    {
      "text": "WHO KNEW THAT\nALL I NEEDED TO\nMAKE PALS...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "afterChoiceFriends": [
    {
      "text": "WOW!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I HAVE FRIENDS!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND WHO KNEW THAT\nALL I NEEDED TO\nMAKE THEM...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "afterDirections": [
    {
      "text": "WAS TO GIVE PEOPLE\nAWFUL PUZZLES AND\nTHEN FIGHT THEM??",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU TAUGHT ME A\nLOT, HUMAN.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I HEREBY GRANT\nYOU PERMISSION\nTO PASS THROUGH!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND I'LL GIVE\nYOU DIRECTIONS\nTO THE SURFACE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "CONTINUE FORWARD\nUNTIL YOU REACH THE\nEND OF THE CAVERN.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN... WHEN YOU\nREACH THE CAPITAL,\nCROSS THE BARRIER.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT'S THE MAGICAL\nSEAL TRAPPING US\nALL UNDERGROUND.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ANYTHING CAN ENTER\nTHROUGH IT, BUT\nNOTHING CAN EXIT...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "... EXCEPT SOMEONE\nWITH A POWERFUL\nSOUL.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "... LIKE YOU!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT'S WHY THE\nKING WANTS TO\nACQUIRE A HUMAN.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HE WANTS TO OPEN\nTHE BARRIER WITH\nSOUL POWER.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN US MONSTERS\nCAN RETURN TO\nTHE SURFACE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
